    description: "12/23 DEEP bakeoff repos have rslice_seeds.json with seeds=[]. Root cause: entrypoint-based seed strategy selects main() functions or bin declarations, which have 0 callers by definition. When entrypoint seeds yield empty results, the system should fall back to top-N high-in-degree symbols. Affected repos: imara-diff, scap, toad, claude-agent-acp, extensions, livekit, workadventure, guacamole-client, guacamole-server, tmux, kamaraflow, bun."  # 9b78
